cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "listenv" in publications use:'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: 'listenv: Environments Behaving (Almost) as Lists'
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.listenv
abstract: List environments are environments that have list-like properties. For instance,
  the elements of a list environment are ordered and can be accessed and iterated
  over using index subsetting, e.g. 'x <- listenv(a = 1, b = 2); for (i in seq_along(x))
  x[[i]] <- x[[i]] ^ 2; y <- as.list(x)'.
